---
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
---
<Page title="Connect your memory"><p class="eyebrow">Finish setup</p><h1>One project.<br/>Every next session.</h1><p id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Checking your payment…</p><section id="result" hidden><h2>Save these credentials now</h2><p>Store your memory token and account recovery code in your password manager. These values are displayed once. The recovery code controls your account; do not paste it into an AI app.</p><label>Memory token<input id="token" readonly autocomplete="off"/></label><label>Account recovery code<input id="recovery" readonly autocomplete="off"/></label><label>MCP endpoint<input id="endpoint" readonly/></label><label>Project ID<input id="project" readonly/></label><h2>Connect your existing tools</h2><p>Cursor: add a remote HTTP MCP server with the endpoint above and an Authorization header of <code>Bearer </code> followed by your memory token. Keep the credential in your tool's private configuration.</p><p>Claude Code: use <code>claude mcp add --transport http hivemind</code> with your endpoint and an <code>Authorization: Bearer</code> header. Avoid shared terminal recordings and shell history when entering credentials.</p><p>Claude and ChatGPT: open your account below and choose “Connect Claude / ChatGPT” beside your access key. Complete secure sign-in in your browser, then add this endpoint through your app's custom connector controls. A Custom GPT Action is a separate REST integration.</p><p>Once connected, use your assistant normally. Enable Hivemind for the conversation and approve access when your app asks. The integration supplies its own memory instructions.</p><a href="/account/">Connect Claude / ChatGPT and manage your account →</a></section><a href="/account/">Already claimed? Open your account</a></Page>
<script>
const status=document.querySelector('#status')!;
let attempts=0;
async function claim(){try{const r=await fetch('/billing/claim',{method:'POST'});const data=await r.json();if(r.status===202){if(++attempts<30){setTimeout(claim,2000);return;}throw new Error('Payment is still processing. Reload this page in a moment.');}if(!r.ok)throw new Error(data.detail);status.textContent='Your memory is ready.';document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('#result')!.hidden=false;for(const [id,value] of Object.entries({token:data.token,recovery:data.recovery_code,endpoint:data.mcp_url,project:data.project_id})){document.querySelector<HTMLInputElement>('#'+id)!.value=String(value);}}catch(e){status.textContent=e instanceof Error?e.message:'Setup could not finish. Reload to retry.';}}
claim();
</script>
